-MemCellType: memristor
-ProcessNode: 22
-AccessType: Diode                // Optimized solver for crossbar logic
-SelectorType: UserDefined
-CellArea (F^2): 4.0               // Idealized Cross-point limit
-CellAspectRatio: 1.0
-ResistanceOn (ohm): 100000        // 1.0e5 (Matsui 2025)
-ResistanceOff (ohm): 1000000000   // 1.0e9 (Matsui 2025)
-ReadLatency (ns): 5
-WriteLatency (ns): 10
-ReadEnergy (pJ): 0.2              // Higher energy due to sneak-path parasitics
-WriteEnergy (pJ): 2.0
-ReadMode: current
-WriteMode: voltage
-ReadVoltage (V): 1.4              // Forced to 1.4V for LOP margin
-WriteVoltage (V): 2.0
-Nonlinearity (Kr): 1000000       // Selectivity target (10^6)